{
  "journeys": [
    {
      "id": "J0",
      "name": "Sign in",
      "persona": "Everyone",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J0.1", "text": "Open the app on a phone or laptop.", "status": "built", "beads": ["supply-checkout-zsm"] },
        {
          "id": "J0.2",
          "text": "Sign in with an email code, a passkey, Apple or Google.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-zsm", "supply-checkout-0b1"],
          "simulated": "Managed Login (Cognito) and Apple and Google are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/auth-api.test.ts", "backend/test/account-link.test.ts"]
        },
        { "id": "J0.3", "text": "If the person belongs to more than one team, pick the team.", "status": "built", "beads": ["supply-checkout-l5y"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J1",
      "name": "Sign up and start a trial",
      "persona": "Owner",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J1.1", "text": "Visit supplycheckout.com, read the pricing page, tap **Start free trial**.", "status": "planned", "beads": ["supply-checkout-21q"] },
        { "id": "J1.2", "text": "Sign up and accept the terms.", "status": "planned", "beads": ["supply-checkout-21q"] },
        {
          "id": "J1.3",
          "text": "Name the team.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-l5y", "supply-checkout-x0l", "supply-checkout-dhc"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/account-api.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J2",
      "name": "Set up the inventory",
      "persona": "Owner",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J2.1", "text": "Open **Inventory**, tap **+ Add item**.", "status": "built" },
        { "id": "J2.2", "text": "Type or scan a barcode (or leave it blank), then enter the name, price and how many are in storage.", "status": "built" },
        { "id": "J2.3", "text": "Edit or delete items later by tapping their row.", "status": "built" },
        {
          "id": "J2.4",
          "text": "Or import an existing inventory: **Import CSV** in **Inventory** checks the file, shows a preview, and imports it.",
          "status": "built",
          "tests": ["backend/test/imports-api.test.ts", "backend/test/imports.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J2.5",
          "text": "In the web app, an owner sets the markup charged on company equipment bought for a client in **Team settings** (0% until set). Only owners see it.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-h9to"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/equipment-api.test.ts", "backend/test/equipment.test.ts", "backend/test/roles.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J3",
      "name": "Invite the crew",
      "persona": "Owner, crew member",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J3.1",
          "text": "The owner opens **Members**, enters a crew member's email and picks **Contributor**.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-5tp", "supply-checkout-dj6"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/invites-api.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J3.2",
          "text": "The crew member gets an email, taps the link on their phone and signs up or signs in.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-5tp", "supply-checkout-5hx"],
          "simulated": "The email (SES) and Managed Login are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/invites-api.test.ts", "backend/test/email.test.ts"]
        }
      ],
      "planned": [{ "what": "opening the mobile app from the invite link (phase 2)" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "J4",
      "name": "Check supplies out and back in",
      "persona": "Crew member",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J4.1", "text": "Create a project for the client and date, or open today's project.", "status": "built" },
        {
          "id": "J4.2",
          "text": "Scan each item's barcode with the phone camera (or type the number, or pick an item that has no barcode) and choose how many.",
          "status": "built",
          "tests": ["backend/test/commands-api.test.ts", "backend/test/commands.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J4.3",
          "text": "Back from the job, switch to **Return**, scan what came back unused, and tap **Finished Return** (which first asks where any company equipment still out is, J13.4).",
          "status": "built",
          "tests": ["backend/test/commands-api.test.ts", "backend/test/commands.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J5",
      "name": "Read a receipt",
      "persona": "Crew member, owner",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J5.1",
          "text": "Tap **Scan receipt** and photograph the receipt.",
          "status": "built",
          "simulated": "Receipt reading is claude.ai's, faked by tests/mock-claude.js"
        },
        { "id": "J5.2", "text": "Check each line: name, quantity, price, and the suggested inventory match.", "status": "built" },
        {
          "id": "J5.3",
          "text": "Assign each line to a client (a new or existing project) or to **General inventory**, then tap **Save**. Company equipment bought for a client is charged on their project (the receipt price plus the team's markup, or a price typed instead); in General inventory it adds to storage and isn't charged.",
          "status": "built",
          "tests": ["backend/test/equipment-api.test.ts", "backend/test/equipment.test.ts"]
        }
      ],
      "planned": [{ "what": "a subscribe link in the trial's receipt limit message, once the in-app plan picker exists", "beads": ["supply-checkout-8jc.5"] }]
    },
    {
      "id": "J6",
      "name": "Export a project to bill a client",
      "persona": "Owner, bookkeeper",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J6.1", "text": "Open a finished project.", "status": "built" },
        { "id": "J6.2", "text": "Tap **Download CSV**.", "status": "built" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J7",
      "name": "Subscribe, add seats and see invoices",
      "persona": "Owner",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J7.1", "text": "Before or at the end of the trial, open **Billing** and choose a plan.", "status": "planned", "beads": ["supply-checkout-8jc.5"] },
        {
          "id": "J7.2",
          "text": "Pay on Stripe Checkout (card, Apple Pay or Google Pay).",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-x0l", "supply-checkout-2kl", "supply-checkout-8jc.20"],
          "simulated": "Stripe Checkout and Stripe's webhooks are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/billing-api.test.ts", "backend/test/billing-webhook.test.ts", "backend/test/billing-worker.test.ts", "backend/test/billing-ddb.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J7.3",
          "text": "Later, invite more people (seats go up) and open past invoices.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-l50", "supply-checkout-eja"],
          "simulated": "Stripe's invoices and subscriptions are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/billing-seats.test.ts", "backend/test/billing-api.test.ts", "backend/test/ops-checks.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J8",
      "name": "A payment fails and is fixed",
      "persona": "Owner",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J8.1",
          "text": "A renewal payment fails.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-2kl"],
          "simulated": "Stripe's webhooks are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/billing-webhook.test.ts", "backend/test/billing-worker.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J8.2",
          "text": "The owner sees a banner and gets an email. The team keeps full access for 7 days.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-qdx"],
          "simulated": "Stripe's webhooks and SES are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/billing-worker.test.ts", "backend/test/account-api.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J8.3",
          "text": "The owner updates their card in the Customer Portal.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-121"],
          "simulated": "The Stripe Customer Portal is a fake in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/billing-worker.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J9",
      "name": "A viewer can see but not change",
      "persona": "Bookkeeper",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J9.1",
          "text": "Sign in and open projects and inventory.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-dj6"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/roles.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J10",
      "name": "Cancel and take the data",
      "persona": "Owner",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J10.1",
          "text": "Open the Customer Portal from **Billing** and cancel.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-121"],
          "simulated": "The Stripe Customer Portal is a fake in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/billing-worker.test.ts"]
        },
        { "id": "J10.2", "text": "Export all projects and inventory.", "status": "built", "beads": ["supply-checkout-zuv"] },
        {
          "id": "J10.3",
          "text": "After 30 days read-only, and at least 7 days after a warning email, the team is closed and its data deleted.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-qdx"],
          "simulated": "Stripe and SES are fakes in the tests",
          "tests": ["backend/test/team-lapse.test.ts", "backend/test/team-lapse-ddb.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J11",
      "name": "Delete an account",
      "persona": "Anyone",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J11.1",
          "text": "Open **Account → Delete account** in the team bar (or **Delete account** on the first screen) and type DELETE.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-b1h"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/account-deletion-api.test.ts", "backend/test/closing.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J11.2",
          "text": "An owner of a team others are in either makes another member an owner or closes the team (**Members → Close the team**, typing its name) first; the app shows the server's message naming those teams.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-b1h"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/account-deletion-api.test.ts", "backend/test/closing.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J12",
      "name": "Choose a plan in the mobile app",
      "persona": "Owner",
      "critical": false,
      "phase2": true,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J12.1", "text": "Open **Plans** in the app and choose a plan and seats.", "status": "planned", "beads": ["supply-checkout-8jc.5"] },
        { "id": "J12.2", "text": "Pay on Stripe Checkout in the in-app browser with Apple Pay or Google Pay.", "status": "planned", "beads": ["supply-checkout-8jc.5"] },
        { "id": "J12.3", "text": "Return to the app.", "status": "planned", "beads": ["supply-checkout-8jc.5"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J13",
      "name": "Take company equipment to a job and bring it back",
      "persona": "Crew member",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        { "id": "J13.1", "text": "In **Inventory**, mark items that go to jobs and come back (ladders, vacuums, cords) as **Company equipment**, with what each is worth.", "status": "built", "beads": ["supply-checkout-h9to"] },
        {
          "id": "J13.2",
          "text": "Check equipment out on a project like any item. It's listed under **Equipment (not charged)**, apart from the supplies, and isn't in the project's total or the client's CSV.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-h9to"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/equipment-api.test.ts", "backend/test/equipment.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J13.3",
          "text": "Back from the job, switch to **Return** and scan what came back.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-h9to"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/equipment-api.test.ts", "backend/test/equipment.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J13.4",
          "text": "Tap **Finished Return**: for each piece still out, say it's back, still at the job, or lost or broken (with an optional charge to the client).",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-h9to"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/equipment-api.test.ts", "backend/test/equipment.test.ts"]
        },
        { "id": "J13.5", "text": "See what's out, on which project, who took it and when, in **Inventory → Equipment → Out on jobs**.", "status": "built", "beads": ["supply-checkout-h9to"] }
      ]
    }
,
    {
      "id": "J14",
      "name": "Take supplies without a job",
      "persona": "Crew member",
      "critical": true,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J14.1",
          "text": "On the project list, tap **Quick take** and scan (or pick) what you're taking, and how many. It goes on **General Use (no job)**, shown above the other projects.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-mdae"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/adhoc-api.test.ts", "backend/test/adhoc.test.ts"]
        },
        { "id": "J14.2", "text": "Bringing something back, tap **Return** on the project list and scan it: it goes back to the project it's out on, or you pick the project when it's out on more than one.", "status": "built", "beads": ["supply-checkout-mdae"] },
        {
          "id": "J14.3",
          "text": "To bill a client for something taken ad hoc, open **General Use (no job)**, tap the line and **Move to a project**.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-mdae"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/adhoc-api.test.ts", "backend/test/adhoc.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J14.4",
          "text": "When the van is restocked, tap **Finished Return** on **General Use (no job)**. The next quick take starts a new one.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-mdae"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/adhoc-api.test.ts", "backend/test/adhoc.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "J15",
      "name": "Reorder before running out",
      "persona": "Owner, crew member",
      "critical": false,
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "J15.1",
          "text": "In **Inventory**, tap an item and set **Reorder at** (the count that means it's running low) and, if you like, **Usual order**.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-005.8"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/reorder.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J15.2",
          "text": "Items at or below their reorder level show **Low** in Inventory, and the **Inventory** tab and **Running low** say how many nobody has acknowledged yet.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-005.8"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J15.3",
          "text": "Open **Running low** to copy or download the reorder list, and tap **Acknowledge** once an item is ordered. It's flagged again if stock falls further, or once it's restocked above the level and runs low again.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-005.8"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/reorder.test.ts", "backend/test/commands.test.ts"]
        },
        {
          "id": "J15.4",
          "text": "Or tap **Mark ordered**, with how many and when (the usual order and today to start). It shows **On order** and isn't flagged until it's restocked above the level and runs low again, or you tap **Cancel order**.",
          "status": "built",
          "beads": ["supply-checkout-005.14"],
          "tests": ["backend/test/reorder.test.ts", "backend/test/commands.test.ts"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
